sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as React terminal
  participant API as FastAPI WebSocket endpoints
  participant Service as MarketDataService
  participant Exchange as Binance or Bybit public stream
  participant Collector as Exchange collector
  participant Queue as Trade queue
  participant Aggregator as CandleAggregator
  participant Store as LiveStore
  participant DB as TimescaleDB
  participant Metrics as Metrics engine
  participant Obs as Observability

  UI->>API: Open market, candle, and metrics WebSockets
  API->>Service: Wait for stream revision changes
  Exchange-->>Collector: Trade message over public WebSocket
  Collector->>Collector: Parse exchange-specific payload
  Collector->>Service: Enqueue canonical Trade
  Service->>Queue: Put Trade
  Queue-->>Service: Consume Trade
  Service->>Store: Update market freshness state
  Service->>Aggregator: Add Trade to candle window
  Service->>DB: Persist raw trade
  Service->>Obs: Record exchange-to-backend latency
  Service-->>API: Notify market and candle revisions
  API-->>UI: Push latest market and candle payloads
  Aggregator-->>Service: Finalized stable candle after allowed lateness window
  Service->>Store: Save stable candle snapshot
  Service->>DB: Persist candle revision
  Service->>Metrics: Queue metric recomputation
  Metrics->>DB: Read candle history when needed
  Metrics-->>Service: Return metrics, events, and correlations
  Service->>DB: Persist metric points and latest summary
  Service-->>API: Notify stable candle and metric revisions
  API-->>UI: Push stable candles and metric snapshot
  UI->>API: POST display-latency
  API->>Obs: Record frontend display latency
